  "description": "The world is wide and full of stories. Your imagination, which had been traveling through your mind non-stop, now unfolds vividly in front of your eyes: a BL anthology connected by keywords of all kinds!\n\n(Source: Manyeo Comics, translated) \n\n1. **Swii** (쉬이-, Shhh-)\n2. **Eotteoke Nahante Ireolsuga** (어떻게 나한테 이럴수가!!, How Could You Do This to Me?)\n3-7. **Gumeonggage** (구멍가게, Hole Shop)\n8-11. **Dangsineun Seontaekbadeun Jaiji** (당신은 선택받은 자이지, You are the Chosen One)\n12-18. **Myeongnangeot** (명란것, Cod Roe)\n19-24. **Sambuja** (삼부자, Three Rich Guys)\n25-28. **Wang Jin-Ju** (왕진주, King Jin-Ju)\n29-35. **Triangle** (트라이앵글, 트라이앵글)\n36-37. **Gumeonggage - Yeoreum** (구멍가게-여름, Hole Shop - Summer)\n38-43. **Myeongnangeot - Sukseong** (명란것-숙성, Cod Roe - Maturing)\n44-45. **Dolsoewa Doryeon-nim** (돌쇠와 도련님, Key and Master)\n46-49. **Deot** (덫, Trap)\n50. **Chaos** (카오스, Chaos)\n51-54. **Full moon**\n55-60. **Yeonghuijina** (영희지나)",
